#: ../../source/outgoing/views.rst:157
msgid ""
"Now, when you call ``view('Example\\Blog\\blog_view')``, CodeIgniter will"
" automatically load your custom view from "
"**app/Views/overrides/Example/Blog/blog_view.php** instead of the "
"original module view file."
